  "semanticConclusion": "Original approved M3 requires economically meaningful interest-bearing leverage and known financing coverage, but does not explicitly require proving all unidentified operating/miscellaneous liabilities contain no financing. Reported-basis split is defensible as an explicit proposed amendment; it is not already approved equivalence to comprehensive debt.",
